  583          <p>
  584:           The <a href="/calculator.html">Testosterone Dosage Calculator</a> provides structured dosing maths and a realistic syringe visual so users can see exactly what they should be drawing. The <a href="/peptide.html">Peptide Calculator</a> handles reconstitution and injection volumes consistently, preventing common mistakes caused by incorrect dilution maths.
  585          </p>
  586          <p>
  587:           Supporting tools like the <a href="/bmi.html">BMI Calculator</a> and the <a href="/free-testosterone-calculator.html">Free Testosterone Calculator</a> exist because hormones don’t operate in isolation. BMI influences metabolic health, and free testosterone gives a clearer picture of hormonal balance than total levels alone.
  588          </p>

